  <!-- AUTOMATION RISK LANDSCAPE -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>AI Automation Risk Landscape</h2>
    <p>Automation risk is not uniform across roles, geographies, or seniority levels. The data reveals a clear hierarchy of vulnerability, with administrative and routine analytical roles facing the steepest exposure, while research and security-oriented functions remain comparatively sheltered.</p>

    <div class="chart">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['ai_risk_trend']}" alt="AI Risk Score Trend">
    </div>

    <div class="insight-box">
      <strong>Trend Insight:</strong> The average AI risk score has climbed steadily from {s['avg_ai_risk_2015']:.2f} in 2015 to {s['avg_ai_risk_2035']:.2f} in 2035. The sharpest acceleration occurs post-2030, suggesting that projected AI capabilities in the next decade will disproportionately affect currently medium-risk roles.
    </div>

    <div class="chart">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['ai_risk_by_job']}" alt="AI Risk by Job Title">
    </div>

    <h3>Risk by Role</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Job Title</th><th>Avg AI Risk Score</th><th>Risk Tier</th><th>Implication</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>AI Researcher</td><td>{s['air_avg_risk']:.2f}</td><td><span class="tag tag-low">Low</span></td><td>Building AI confers strong protection</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cybersecurity Analyst</td><td>0.25</td><td><span class="tag tag-low">Low</span></td><td>Security specialization is resilient</td></tr>
        <tr><td>ML Engineer</td><td>0.25</td><td><span class="tag tag-low">Low</span></td><td>Model-building roles are in demand</td></tr>
        <tr><td>DevOps Engineer</td><td>0.30</td><td><span class="tag tag-medium">Medium</span></td><td>Infrastructure roles face moderate pressure</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Data Scientist</td><td>0.35</td><td><span class="tag tag-medium">Medium</span></td><td>Analytical work is partially automatable</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Cloud Engineer</td><td>0.35</td><td><span class="tag tag-medium">Medium</span></td><td>Platform work is increasingly templated</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Product Manager</td><td>0.40</td><td><span class="tag tag-medium">Medium</span></td><td>Strategic judgment remains valued</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Software Engineer</td><td>0.45</td><td><span class="tag tag-medium">Medium</span></td><td>Coding assistance tools raise exposure</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Data Analyst</td><td>0.65</td><td><span class="tag tag-high">High</span></td><td>Reporting & dashboards are highly automatable</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Business Analyst</td><td>{s['ba_avg_risk']:.2f}</td><td><span class="tag tag-high">High</span></td><td>Routine business analysis faces the highest risk</td></tr>
