    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- SALARY TRENDS -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Salary Trends & Segmentation</h2>
    <p>Compensation trends reveal a nuanced picture: while median salaries have grown across the board, the relationship between pay and automation risk is strongly negative. Higher-risk roles consistently earn less, and this gap widens for senior professionals.</p>

    <div class="chart">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['salary_trend_country']}" alt="Median Salary Trend by Country">
    </div>

    <div class="insight-box">
