    </div>

    <div class="chart">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64,{charts['salary_exp_risk']}" alt="Salary by Experience and Risk">
    </div>

    <div class="warning-box">
      <strong>Experience × Risk Interaction:</strong> At the Senior level, the salary gap between Low Risk and High Risk categories becomes pronounced. Senior professionals in low-risk roles earn substantially more than their high-risk counterparts, suggesting that experience amplifies returns in resilient roles while offering limited protection in automatable ones.
    </div>

    <h3>Compensation by Risk Category</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Risk Category</th><th>Median Salary</th><th>vs. High Risk Premium</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Low Risk</td><td>${s['low_risk_median_salary']:,.0f}</td><td>+{s['salary_risk_gap_pct']:.0f}%</td></tr>
