      <em>Data basis:</em> Business Analysts and Data Analysts represent the highest automation risk ({s['ba_avg_risk']:.2f} and 0.65 average risk scores) and also account for the largest share of total job openings. Reskilling these populations toward data science, ML engineering, or AI research yields the highest organizational ROI.<br><br>
